#: ../../peps/peps/pep-0743.rst:347
msgid ""
"If any of these proposed replacements, or associated documentation, are not "
"added in time for 3.14.0b1, they'll be omitted with later versions of "
"``Py_COMPAT_API_VERSION``. (We expect this for macros generated by "
"``configure``: ``HAVE_*``, ``WITH_*``, ``ALIGNOF_*``, ``SIZEOF_*``, and "
"several without a common prefix.)"
msgstr ""

